{"input": "Summarize the whole meeting.", "answers": ["It was the last meeting of the group and focused on detail design. First, the user interface designer displayed the appearance and the texture of the product with a working prototype. After that, the industrial designer gave some technical specifications on the product. In the product evaluation that included several criteria, the controller got an average score of two point one seven, which implied it was good. When it came to the quotation of product components, the original one was seventeen dot eight dollars, which was apparently over budget. After some discussions about battery and operations on the calculator, the group finally cut the cost down to under twelve dollars. Finally, they did some self-assessment and celebrated the completion of the project."], "length": 8554, "dataset": "qmsum", "pred": "The meeting was a project evaluation meeting for a remote control device with a strawberry design. The team discussed the device's features, including its functionality, design, and potential uses. They evaluated the device based on criteria such as fanciness, usefulness, size and weight, and cost. The team decided to proceed with the project, and the project manager proposed a celebration to mark the successful evaluation. The meeting concluded with the team deciding to go out to an Italian restaurant and then attend a party to celebrate the project's success."}
