{"input": "How would the mental spaces operate?", "answers": ["Mental spaces can be tackled with mechanisms that can also deal with context issues (time, space etc.): creating a base space and rules of interaction with other interconnected spaces. However, the complexity of these mechanisms has to be bound as well: it is necessary to define the range of constructions to be studied. "], "length": 24580, "dataset": "qmsum", "pred": "The mental spaces would operate by creating a mental representation of the situation, taking into account the context, discourse, and ontology. The mental spaces would be used to guide the interpretation of the discourse, and would be updated as new information is added. The mental spaces would also be used to resolve ambiguities and to disambiguate the meaning of the discourse. The mental spaces would be updated and refined as the discourse progresses, and would be used to generate the final interpretation of the discourse."}
